          "body": "I don't recall if I already gave the instructions, but here they are again. :-)\n\nTo publish static files to our website, just commit them to the jackrabbit/site folder in svn, from where they will automatically be deployed to the public web site. See http://jackrabbit.apache.org/website.html for the details.",
